r←testArrowConversion;req
⎕CS ##
⍝ Isolated test for non-deprecated Arrow conversion wrappers.
⍝ This test intentionally avoids runtime ArrowSchema/ArrowArray marshalling until
⍝ explicit APL-side struct scaffolding is in place.

:If 0=⎕NC'null'
    init 'lib/'
:EndIf

req←{0::⍺,' - FAILED: ',⎕DMX.Message ⋄ ⍵:⍺,' - OK' ⋄ ⍺,' - FAILED'}
r←⊂'Test Arrow Conversion API (safe mode)'

r,←⊂'toArrowSchema wrapper exists' req 3=⎕NC'toArrowSchema'
r,←⊂'dataChunkToArrow wrapper exists' req 3=⎕NC'dataChunkToArrow'
r,←⊂'duckdb_to_arrow_schema binding exists' req 3=api.⎕NC'duckdb_to_arrow_schema'
r,←⊂'duckdb_data_chunk_to_arrow binding exists' req 3=api.⎕NC'duckdb_data_chunk_to_arrow'
r,←⊂'Runtime conversion skipped pending Arrow struct interop' req 1

r,←⊂''
r,←⊂'Arrow conversion API testing complete!'
⎕←↑r

⍝ KSL 1.0.0
